      '“As well as, along with, together with, with, in addition to, accompanied by, besides” कर्त्याला अनेकवचनी बनवत नाहीत: “The teacher, along with her students, <b>was</b> present.”',
      'Each, every, either, neither, everyone, someone, nobody, each of + अनेकवचनी नाम → एकवचनी क्रियापद: “Each of the boys <b>has</b> a bicycle.”',
      'Either…or, neither…nor, not only…but also, or, nor → क्रियापद जवळच्या कर्त्याशी जुळते: “Neither the coach nor the players <b>were</b> happy.”',
      '<i>and</i> ने जोडलेले दोन कर्ते → अनेकवचनी; पण ते एकाच व्यक्तीचे किंवा एकाच कल्पनेचे नाव असतील तर एकवचनी: “The secretary and treasurer <b>is</b> here” (एकच व्यक्ती); “Bread and butter <b>is</b> my breakfast.”',
      '“The number of” → एकवचनी; “A number of” → अनेकवचनी. “Many a” + एकवचनी नाम → एकवचनी क्रियापद: “Many a student <b>has</b> tried.”',
